msgid "AirbotPower Power Module"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:7
#: 2c9dac01f7904e08b8bbad5c61f7113c
msgid "This page explains how to set up the `AirbotPower Power Module <http://www.airbotservices.com/airbotpower.html>`__ and *AirbotPDB* stackable companion power distribution board."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:9
#: cf9ef6e81d6e4a219d8179e6b275b8bd
msgid "This power module is useful for higher power systems (battery voltage from 4S to 8S and currents from 90 amps to 150 amps). The board encapsulates all the wiring and complexity described in :ref:`Powering the Autopilot <common-powering-the-pixhawk>`) in a single, simple package."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:12
#: 2e9dec4538d444319071d47c514c9f49
msgid "Overview"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:14
#: 913d3cbc3fa3489892ff36d634a6bd81
msgid "The AirbotPower Power Module (and *AirbotPDB* stackable companion power distribution board) provides a reliable and simple way to power an autopilot and other UAV components."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:22
#: 6186f60c5f1649f884a2673845af535d
msgid "AirbotPower provides three power feeds: 2x 5.3V & 1x 12V (up to 3.5 amps each) and can supply main power to autopilot’s power port, backup power to the servo rail and power for an FPV system. It provides current and voltage measurements through the main power port, up to 150 amps and 8S."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-airbotpower-power-module.rst:27
#: af69d2cf79a74717bb4a9cc7f3a5c68d
msgid "The following sections provide an overview of the setup. For more detailed information about the benefits of this board and setup see:"
msgstr ""

